community/Op skills and search for perf-related skills\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b64adb5a811e97ec","content":"[exit code: 0]\nascendc-op-doc-generator\nascendc-op-doc-incremental\nascendc-operator-code-gen\nascendc-operator-code-review\nascendc-operator-compile-debug\nascendc-operator-design\nascendc-operator-dev\nascendc-operator-doc-gen\nascendc-operator-doc-writer\nascendc-operator-mssanitizer\nascendc-operator-performance-eval\nascendc-operator-performance-optim\nascendc-operator-precision-debug\nascendc-operator-precision-eval\nascendc-operator-project-init\nascendc-operator-st-gen\nascendc-operator-testcase-gen\ncatlass-operator-code-gen\ncatlass-operator-design\ncatlass-operator-dev\ncatlass-operator-performance-optim\nshmem-ops-code-gen\nshmem-ops-code-review\nshmem-ops-compile-debug\nshmem-ops-correctness-eval\nshmem-ops-design\nshmem-ops-dev\nshmem-ops-performance-eval\nshmem-ops-performance-optim\nshmem-ops-testcase-gen\nshmem-ops-torch-bind\nsimple-vector-triton-gpu-to-npu\ntilelang-vector-ascend-ops-migration\nvector-triton-ascend-ops-optimizer\n===\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/community/Op/shmem-ops-performance-optim\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/community/Op/shmem-ops-performance-eval\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/community/Op/catlass-operator-performance-optim\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/community/Op/ascendc-operator-performance-eval\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/community/Op/ascendc-operator-performance-optim\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/MindSeriesSDK/AgentSDK/agent-perf-analyzer\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/PyTorch/npu-graph-skill/graph-performance-profiling\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/MindStudio/skills/ascendc-operator-performance-optim\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/graph/torch-npugraph-ex-performance-diagnosis\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-performance-best-practices\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/pypto-op-perf-tune\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/catlass-op-perf-tune\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8e62cdc51c64979","type":"function","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"ls -R /home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize 2>/dev/null | head -30\",\"description\":\"List the ascendc-perf-optimize skill contents\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8e62cdc51c64979","content":"[exit code: 0]\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize:\nSKILL.md\nreferences\n\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references:\ncomm-compute\ninter-core-pipeline\nsingle-core-pipeline\ntiling\n\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/comm-compute:\nindex.md\n\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/inter-core-pipeline:\nindex.md\n\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/single-core-pipeline:\nindex.md\nmemory.md\nno-bound.md\nscalar.md\nvec.md\n\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling:\nbroadcast\nconversion\nconvolution\nelewise\nfa\nindex.md\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-84e3209a7695c67f","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/SKILL.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-84e3209a7695c67f","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: ascendc-perf-optimize\n3\tdescription: Ascend C 算子性能优化策略制定。结合 Tiling 建模与流水分析（仿真图 + profiling 数据），按卡间/核间/核内三层流水制定性能优化策略，并回修 Tiling 参数。触发：算子性能调优、流水分析、Tiling 修正、bound 诊断时。\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\t# Ascend C 算子性能优化流水分析\n7\t\n8\t## 优化流程\n9\t\n10\t```\n11\t给定：算子类型、计算流程（kernel 代码/伪代码）、profiling 数据、仿真图（可选）\n12\t\n13\tStep 1 — Tiling 理论建模 → 输出理想 tiling data\n14\tStep 2 — 通信类算子？ → 通算演算优化策略（卡间流水分析 + tiling 修正）\n15\tStep 3 — 多核间同步算子？ → 核间流水优化策略（核间流水分析 + tiling 修正）\n16\tStep 4 — 单核流水优化策略（核内流水分析 + tiling 修正）\n17\t```\n18\t\n19\t每步的\"流水\"分析包含**仿真图解读**和 **profiling 数据**分析报告。Step 2/3/4 的策略输出均包含对 Step 1 tiling 策略的修正建议。\n20\t\n21\t---\n22\t\n23\t## Step 1 — Tiling 理论建模\n24\t\n25\t**输入**：算子类型、Shape、dtype、计算流程\n26\t\n27\t**过程**：根据算子 pattern 路由到对应的 Tiling 理论模型目录（详见 `references/tiling/`，入口为 `references/tiling/index.md`），输出理想 tiling data。\n28\t\n29\t**输出**：\n30\t- [ ] 卡间切分方案（切分维度、通信内算子涉及）\n31\t- [ ] 多核切分方案（切分维度、单核任务量、核数）\n32\t- [ ] 单核切分方案：\n33\t  - Cube/融合类：L1 split（baseM/baseN/baseK、L1 ping-pong）+ L0 split（mL0/nL0/kL0）\n34\t  - Vec 类：UB split（block_size、repeat）\n35\t- [ ] Buffer 规划（各 buffer 用途与大小，区分 L1/L0/UB 层级）\n36\t- [ ] 分支场景覆盖（dtype、shape 大小、对齐）\n37\t\n38\t---\n39\t\n40\t## Step 2 — 通算演算优化策略（卡间流水）\n41\t\n42\t**适用条件**：通信类算子（如 AllReduce、AllGather、ReduceScatter 等）。\n43\t\n44\t非通信类算子**跳过**此步骤。\n45\t\n46\t**输入**：Step 1 的 tiling data + 计算流程 + 仿真图 + profiling 数据\n47\t\n48\t**过程**：加载 `references/comm-compute/`，分析卡间通信与计算的流水重叠，识别通信瓶颈。\n49\t\n50\t**输出**：\n51\t- [ ] 卡间流水仿真图分析\n52\t- [ ] 通信/profiling 数据报告\n53\t- [ ] 卡间流水优化策略\n54\t- [ ] 对 Step 1 tiling 策略的修正建议\n55\t\n56\t> 当前 `references/comm-compute/` 内容为空，此步骤返回「通算演算优化策略暂未收录，跳过卡间流水分析」。\n57\t\n58\t---\n59\t\n60\t## Step 3 — 核间流水优化策略\n61\t\n62\t**适用条件**：涉及多核间同步的算子（如跨核同步、核间数据依赖等）。\n63\t\n64\t非多核同步算子**跳过**此步骤。\n65\t\n66\t**输入**：Step 1 的 tiling data + 计算流程 + 仿真图 + profiling 数据\n67\t\n68\t**过程**：加载 `references/inter-core-pipeline/`，分析多核间的流水并行效率。\n69\t\n70\t**输出**：\n71\t- [ ] 核间流水仿真图分析\n72\t- [ ] 核间 profiling 数据报告\n73\t- [ ] 核间流水优化策略\n74\t- [ ] 对 Step 1 tiling 策略的修正建议\n75\t\n76\t> 当前 `references/inter-core-pipeline/` 内容为空，此步骤返回「核间流水优化策略暂未收录，跳过核间流水分析」。\n77\t\n78\t---\n79\t\n80\t## Step 4 — 单核流水优化策略\n81\t\n82\t**适用条件**：所有算子。\n83\t\n84\t**输入**：Step 1 的 tiling data + 计算流程 + 仿真图 + profiling 数据 + 前几步的策略输出\n85\t\n86\t**过程**：加载 `references/single-core-pipeline/`，通过仿真图数据和 profiling 数据判定 bound 类型，按 bound 展开优化。\n87\t\n88\t**输出**：\n89\t- [ ] 核内流水仿真图分析\n90\t- [ ] 核内 profiling 数据报告（bound 诊断结论）\n91\t- [ ] 核内流水优化策略\n92\t- [ ] 对 Step 1 tiling 策略的修正建议\n93\t- [ ] 最终优化方案汇总\n94\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-846d834017e4ac85","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/single-core-pipeline/index.md\"}"}},{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a2152954c443841","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/index.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-846d834017e4ac85","content":"1\t# 单核流水优化策略\n2\t\n3\t> 核内流水分析，通过仿真图或者 profiling 数据判定 bound 类型，按 bound 展开优化策略。\n4\t> 结合仿真图或者 profiling 数据诊断瓶颈，输出优化方案并回修 tiling 参数。\n5\t\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\t## Bound 判定流程\n9\t\n10\t```\n11\t给定：仿真图 或者 profiling 数据（含 MTE2/CUBE/Vector 利用率、带宽、指令发射率）\n12\t\n13\tStep 1 — 初步判定：\n14\t  ├─  scalar耗时占比高 或者 计算量小 → Scalar Bound / 小 case → scalar.md\n15\t  ├─ MTE2/访存单元利用率高 + 带宽为主要限制 → 访存 Bound → memory.md\n16\t  ├─ Vector 单元利用率高 + 向量指令为主要限制 → Vec Bound → vec.md\n17\t  └─ 各单元利用率均不高 → 无 Bound → no-bound.md\n18\t\n19\tStep 2 — 确认与细分：\n20\t  根据仿真图时间轴确认判定结论，排除误判（如访存等计算 vs 计算等访存）。\n21\t```\n22\t\n23\t## Bound 路由\n24\t\n25\t| Bound 类型 | 判定条件 | 优化策略文档 |\n26\t|-----------|---------|------------|\n27\t| Scalar Bound / 小 case | scalar占比最高或者计算量极小或 shape 很小 | [scalar.md](scalar.md) |\n28\t| 访存 Bound | MTE2/AIC 带宽为主导瓶颈 | [memory.md](memory.md) |\n29\t| Vec Bound | Vector 指令为主导瓶颈 | [vec.md](vec.md) |\n30\t| 无 Bound | 无明显瓶颈 | [no-bound.md](no-bound.md) |\n31\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a2152954c443841","content":"1\t# 算子 Tiling 理论建模\n2\t\n3\t> 按算子 pattern 路由到对应的 Tiling 建模参考目录。每个 pattern 有独立的建模文件夹，包含该族算子的 Tiling 理论模型、参数推导和门禁决策逻辑。\n4\t>\n5\t> 输出统一格式的理想 tiling data（多核切分、Buffer 规划、分支覆盖）。\n6\t\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t## Pattern 路由表\n10\t\n11\t| 算子类别 | 典型算子 | 建模目录 |\n12\t|---------|---------|---------|\n13\t| MatMul 矩阵乘类 | MatMul, BatchMatMul, MatMul_MXFP4, MatMul_A16W16, MatMul_AllReduce | [matmul/](matmul/) |\n14\t| Reduction 归约类 | ReduceSum, Softmax, LayerNorm, ArgMax | [reduction/](reduction/) |\n15\t| Elementwise 逐元素类 | Sin, Cos, Abs, Exp | [elewise/](elewise/) |\n16\t| Broadcast 广播类 | Add, Mul, Sub | [broadcast/](broadcast/) |\n17\t| Conversion 数据转换类 | Transpose, Concat, Split | [conversion/](conversion/) |\n18\t| Convolution 卷积类 | Conv2D, DepthwiseConv | [convolution/](convolution/) |\n19\t| FA FlashAttention 类 | FlashAttention, GroupNorm | [fa/](fa/) |\n20\t\n21\t## 路由流程\n22\t\n23\t```\n24\t给定：算子名 + Shape + dtype\n25\t\n26\tStep 0 — 算子分类：\n27\t  ├─ MatMul 族 → matmul/\n28\t  ├─ Reduction 族 → reduction/\n29\t  ├─ Elementwise 族 → elewise/\n30\t  ├─ Broadcast 族 → broadcast/\n31\t  ├─ Conversion 族 → conversion/\n32\t  ├─ Convolution 族 → convolution/\n33\t  ├─ FA 族 → fa/\n34\t  └─ 未匹配 → 返回「该算子 pattern 暂未收录，请提供更多信息」\n35\t```\n36\t\n37\t---\n38\t\n39\t## 算法注册表\n40\t\n41\t每个算子族目录下 `index.md` 是该族的**算法路由**，负责将具体 shape/dtype 条件路由到正确算法。各算子族有一个**默认参考算法**（由 `index.md` 兜底），社区可贡献替代算法（放入子目录），通过路由条件匹配选择。\n42\t\n43\t**两级路由**：\n44\t1. `tiling/index.md`（本文件）→ 按算子范式路由到 `tiling/<范式>/index.md`\n45\t2. `tiling/<范式>/index.md` → 按 shape/dtype 条件路由到具体算法\n46\t\n47\t**选择逻辑**：\n48\t1. 遍历该算子族的所有贡献算法，按优先级从高到低匹配条件\n49\t2. 首个条件匹配的贡献算法被选中\n50\t3. 无匹配时回退到默认参考算法\n51\t\n52\t### 当前注册\n53\t\n54\t| 算子族 | 算法路由 | 兜底算法 | 扩展算法 | 选择条件 |\n55\t|--------|---------|---------|---------|---------|\n56\t| MatMul | [matmul/](matmul/) | [fallback/](matmul/fallback/)（SWAT / FullLoad / StreamK） | — | — |\n57\t| Convolution | [convolution/](convolution/) | [fallback/](convolution/fallback/)（FORMULAS: Mmode + HWmode） | — | — |\n58\t| Reduction | [reduction/](reduction/) | [fallback/](reduction/fallback/)（占位） | — | — |\n59\t| Elementwise | [elewise/](elewise/) | [fallback/](elewise/fallback/)（占位） | — | — |\n60\t| Broadcast | [broadcast/](broadcast/) | [fallback/](broadcast/fallback/)（占位） | — | — |\n61\t| Conversion | [conversion/](conversion/) | [fallback/](conversion/fallback/)（占位） | — | — |\n62\t| FA | [fa/](fa/) | [fallback/](fa/fallback/)（占位） | — | — |\n63\t\n64\t### 贡献新算法\n65\t\n66\t在 `<算子族>/` 下创建新目录，包含 `index.md`（算法描述、适用条件、tiling 推导）。同时在 `<算子族>/index.md` 的算法路由表中注册，注明选择条件和优先级。条件可以是 dtype、shape 范围、核数等任意可判定字段的组合。\n67\t\n68\t---\n69\t\n70\t## Buffer 层级约定\n71\t\n72\t不同算子类型的 on-chip buffer 层级不同，Tiling 输出需区分：\n73\t\n74\t| 算子类型 | 主要 Buffer | 说明 |\n75\t|---------|------------|------|\n76\t| **Vec 类**（Elementwise, Broadcast, Conversion, Reduction 部分） | **UB** | 数据从 GM → UB，计算在 UB 上完成，无 L1 参与 |\n77\t| **Cube 类**（MatMul, Convolution） | **L1 + UB** | 数据 GM → L1 → L0 → Cube，L1 做全局复用缓冲，UB 做 weight/fmap DMA 暂存 |\n78\t| **融合类**（FA 等） | **L1 + UB** | 多层流水，L1 承载大块数据驻留，UB 承载计算窗口 |\n79\t\n80\t> **关键区分**：Cube/融合类算子的切分粒度在 **L1**（不是 UB），L1 split 决定了单次搬运的数据量；L0/UB 是 L1 的进一步子切分。\n81\t\n82\t---\n83\t\n84\t## 理想 Tiling Data 输出格式\n85\t\n86\t### Cube / 融合类（L1 + UB 两级）\n87\t\n88\t```yaml\n89\ttiling_data:\n90\t  multicore:\n91\t    split_dim: \"M,N\"\n92\t    single_core_m: 128\n93\t    single_core_n: 256\n94\t    core_num: 8\n95\t  l1_split:                    # L1 是主切分层\n96\t    base_m: 64\n97\t    base_n: 128\n98\t    base_k: 32\n99\t    need_chunk: false\n100\t    chunk_formula: \"\"\n101\t    double_buffer: \"A1_B1\"     # L1 ping-pong 策略\n102\t  l0_split:                    # L0 是 L1 的子切分\n103\t    mL0: 64\n104\t    nL0: 16\n105\t    kL0: 16\n106\t  ub_split:                    # UB 是 weight/fmap DMA 暂存\n107\t    weight_trans: false\n108\t    fmap_dma: false\n109\t  buffers:\n110\t    - name: L1_A\n111\t      size_formula: \"kAL1 * baseM * sizeof(AType) * (pbAL1 ? 2 : 1)\"\n112\t    - name: L1_B\n113\t      size_formula: \"kBL1 * baseN * sizeof(BType) * (pbBL1 ? 2 : 1)\"\n114\t    - name: L0_C\n115\t      size_formula: \"mL0 * nL0 * sizeof(float32) * (pbCL0 ? 2 : 1)\"\n116\t  branches:\n117\t    - dim: dtype\n118\t      conditions: [\"fp16\", \"bf16\", \"fp32\"]\n119\t    - dim: shape_size\n120\t      conditions: [\"large\", \"small\"]\n121\t```\n122\t\n123\t### Vec 类（仅 UB）\n124\t\n125\t```yaml\n126\ttiling_data:\n127\t  multicore:\n128\t    split_dim: \"batch\"\n129\t    single_core_size: 4096\n130\t    core_num: 4\n131\t  ub_split:                    # UB 是唯一切分层\n132\t    block_size: 256\n133\t    repeat: 16\n134\t  buffers:\n135\t    - name: UB_in\n136\t      size_formula: \"block_size * sizeof(dtype)\"\n137\t    - name: UB_out\n138\t      size_formula: \"block_size * sizeof(dtype)\"\n139\t  branches:\n140\t    - dim: dtype\n141\t      conditions: [\"fp16\", \"fp32\"]\n142\t```\n143\t\n144\t---\n145\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a49db8f8b6badf5c","type":"function","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"find /home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul -type f | head; echo \\\"===\\\"; ls /home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul 2>/dev/null\",\"description\":\"List matmul tiling reference files\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a49db8f8b6badf5c","content":"[exit code: 0]\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul/index.md\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul/fallback/fallback-algorithm.md\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul/fallback/tiling-variants.md\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul/fallback/tiling-flow.md\n/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul/fallback/tiling-fields.md\n===\nfallback\nindex.md\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-900d37aa3c7fa59b","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul/index.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-900d37aa3c7fa59b","content":"1\t# MatMul 族 Tiling 算法路由\n2\t\n3\t> MatMul 族（matmul / matmul_a16w16 / matmul_mxfp4 / batch_matmul / group_matmul）Tiling 算法入口。\n4\t>\n5\t> 按条件路由到具体算法，默认使用 fallback 兜底算法。\n6\t\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t## 1. 路由规则\n10\t\n11\t```\n12\t给定：算子类型 + Shape + dtype\n13\t\n14\t遍历已注册算法（按优先级降序），匹配选择条件：\n15\t  ├─ 命中 → 路由到该算法\n16\t  └─ 未命中任何扩展算法 → 回退到 fallback 兜底算法\n17\t```\n18\t\n19\t---\n20\t\n21\t## 2. 已注册算法\n22\t\n23\t| 优先级 | 算法 | 选择条件 | 目录 |\n24\t|--------|------|---------|------|\n25\t| 0（兜底） | 官方参考 | 无条件（回退保障） | [fallback/](fallback/) |\n26\t\n27\t---\n28\t\n29\t## 3. 贡献新算法\n30\t\n31\t在 `matmul/` 下创建新目录，在此文件的路由表中注册选择条件和优先级：\n32\t\n33\t```\n34\tmatmul/\n35\t├── index.md              # 本文件（算法路由）\n36\t├── fallback/             # 官方参考算法\n37\t│   ├── fallback-algorithm.md\n38\t│   ├── tiling-flow.md\n39\t│   ├── tiling-fields.md\n40\t│   └── tiling-variants.md\n41\t└── <算法名>/             # 社区贡献\n42\t    └── algorithm.md\n43\t```\n44\t\n45\t选择条件可以是 dtype、shape 范围、核数等任意可判定字段的组合。\n46\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a870479db6408eb8","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul/fallback/fallback-algorithm.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a870479db6408eb8","content":"1\t# MatMul 族 — 兜底算法（官方参考）\n2\t\n3\t> MatMul 族所有变体（a16w16 / mxfp4 / mxfp8 / batch_matmul / group_matmul）共享的官方参考 Tiling 算法。\n4\t>\n5\t> 按 **dtype / Scale / 特有维度** 找对应变体，再按 **Shape 条件** 选择策略（SWAT / FullLoad / StreamK）。\n6\t\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t## 1. 路由流程\n10\t\n11\t```\n12\t给定：算子名 + Shape + dtype\n13\t\n14\tStep 0 — 变体路由：\n15\t  ├─ dtype = FP16/BF16, 无 Scale, 无 batch/group → a16w16（基线）\n16\t  ├─ dtype = FP4/FP8, 有 per-group Scale         → mxfp4/8\n17\t  ├─ 有 batch 维 (B, M, K) × (B, K, N)           → batch_matmul\n18\t  ├─ 有 group 维 (g groups, M_i 不等)             → group_matmul\n19\t  └─ 未匹配 → 找最相似的已知变体，标注差异\n20\t\n21\tStep 1 — 策略选择：\n22\t  ├─ StreamK 判定通过   → StreamK（K 轴切分多核）\n23\t  ├─ FullLoad 判定通过  → FullLoad（A 或 B 驻留 L1）\n24\t  └─ 否则              → SWAT（默认回退）\n25\t```\n26\t\n27\t---\n28\t\n29\t## 2. 算法策略\n30\t\n31\t| 策略 | 适用条件 | 核心思想 |\n32\t|------|---------|---------|\n33\t| **SWAT**（默认） | 所有 Shape | K 轴流式迭代，七步推导 |\n34\t| **FullLoad** | A 或 B 能全量驻留 L1，对侧 T ≥ 2 | 小矩阵一次载入驻留 |\n35\t| **StreamK** | K ≥ 32768 且 B=1 且无 group | K 轴切分给多核并行 |\n36\t\n37\t---\n38\t\n39\t## 3. 索引\n40\t\n41\t| 文档 | 内容 |\n42\t|------|------|\n43\t| [tiling-flow.md](tiling-flow.md) | 通用 Tiling 七步推导 + SWAT/FullLoad/StreamK 算法细节 |\n44\t| [tiling-fields.md](tiling-fields.md) | 跨变体 TilingData 字段语义对照表 |\n45\t| [tiling-variants.md](tiling-variants.md) | 各变体（a16w16 / mxfp4 / batch / group）差异说明 |\n46\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3b85aecd78b8078","type":"function","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/agent-skills/official/CANNBot/ops/ascendc-perf-optimize/references/tiling/matmul/fallback/tiling-flow.md\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3b85aecd78b8078","content":"1\t# MatMul 族 — 通用 Tiling 流程\n2\t\n3\t> MatMul 族所有变体（a16w16 / mxfp4 / mxfp8 / batch_matmul / group_matmul）共享的 Tiling 推导流程。\n4\t>\n5\t> 核心流程：**初始分块 → 边缘优化 → 尾块处理 → L0C 缓冲 → L1 深度 → 缓冲数 → 组装**，七步递进。\n6\t>\n7\t> 变体差异见 [tiling-variants.md](tiling-variants.md)，跨变体字段见 [tiling-fields.md](tiling-fields.md)。\n8\t>\n9\t> **算法来源**：CANN `conv_api_tiling_*.cpp`（arch35），关键常量定义见 `conv_api_tiling_util.h` / `conv_template_utils.h`。\n10\t\n11\t---\n12\t\n13\t## 1. 算法三元组\n14\t\n15\tMatMul Tiling 有三种算法策略，互斥选择：\n16\t\n17\t| 算法 | 核心思想 | 适用条件 |\n18\t|------|---------|---------|\n19\t| **SWAT**（默认基线） | K 轴流式迭代，数据沿 K 分段载入 L1，每次只驻留一小段，计算完即滚动 | 所有 Shape，为回退保障 |\n20\t| **FullLoad** | A 或 B 全量驻留 L1，消除 K 轴重复搬运 | A 或 B 全载于 L1 内，对侧循环 ≥ 2 |\n21\t| **StreamK** | K 轴切分给多核，每核负责一段 K，workspace 归约 | K ≥ 32768 且 B=1 且无 group |\n22\t\n23\t**互斥关系**：StreamK ⊥ FullLoad（StreamK 下 K 分散到多核，驻留语义失效）。\n24\t\n25\t---\n26\t\n27\t## 2. 关键常量\n28\t\n29\t| 常量 | 值 | 含义 |\n30\t|------|----|----|\n31\t| `CUBE_BLOCK` | 16 | Cube 单元最小粒度，所有分块尺寸对齐到 16 |\n32\t| `DB_SIZE` | 2 | Double buffer 深度，L1 中 A/B 各保留 2 份实现 pingpong |\n33\t| `WINDOW_LEN` | 4 | 边缘合并滑动窗口，一次最多合并 4 个基本块 |\n34\t| `BASEM_BASEN_RATIO` | 2 | baseM/baseN 最大比例，防止维度失衡 |\n35\t| `STEPKA_THRESHOLD` | 4 | StreamK 下 stepK 截断上限 |\n36\t\n37\t---\n38\t\n39\t## 3. SWAT 七步推导\n40\t\n41\tSWAT 是默认基线，也是 FullLoad 和 StreamK 的推导基础。\n42\t\n43\t```\n44\tDoOpTiling():\n45\t  ├── _calc_basic_block()              # §3.1 初始分块 + 核利用率调整\n46\t  ├── _optimize_edge_basic_block()     # §3.2 M 方向边缘合并 (SWAT 机制 B)\n47\t  ├── _calc_tail_basic_block()         # §3.3 尾块拆分\n48\t  ├── _init_l0c_buffer_mode()          # §3.4 L0C 双缓冲判定\n49\t  ├── _calc_path_specific_l1()         # §3.5 L1 深度 + stepK\n50\t  ├── _calculate_n_buffer_num()        # §3.6 L1 缓冲数 (4 or 2)\n51\t  └── _build_tiling_data()             # §3.7 组装 TilingData\n52\t```\n53\t\n54\t### 3.1 初始分块\n55\t\n56\t确定 Cube 单元一次计算多大的块（baseM × baseN × baseK）。\n57\t\n58\t```\n59\t1. 候选值:\n60\t   baseM = min(Align(M, 16), 256)\n61\t   baseN = min(Align(N, 16), 256)\n62\t   baseK = min(Align(K, 16), L0A容量 / (DB_SIZE × sizeof(dtype) × max(baseM, baseN)))\n63\t```\n64\t\n65\t**核利用率检查**：用 baseM/baseN 算出总块数（mBlockCnt × nBlockCnt）。若总块数 < aicNum，说明分块太粗、核用不满，需要调小 baseM 或 baseN。\n66\t\n67\t```\n68\t2. 核利用率检查:\n69\t   mBlockCnt = CeilDiv(M, baseM)\n70\t   nBlockCnt = CeilDiv(N, baseN)\n71\t   totalBlockCnt = mBlockCnt × nBlockCnt\n72\t   若 totalBlockCnt < aicNum → _adjust_basic_block() 重平衡\n73\t```\n74\t\n75\t**_adjust_basic_block()**：优先调 tile 数较少的方向（更需要拆分），保持 baseM/baseN ≤ 2:1。调整后重算 baseK。\n76\t\n77\t### 3.2 边缘合并（SWAT 机制 B）\n78\t\n79\tM 不能被 baseM 整除时，末尾有不完整的\"尾块\"。边缘合并把最后几个完整块与尾块合并，重新划分为大小均匀的块，避免超小尾块导致 Cube 利用率骤降。\n80\t\n81\t```\n82\t当 M % baseM > 0 且 K 内轴满足 cacheline 对齐时:\n83\t\n84\t滑动窗口 (WINDOW_LEN=4) 搜索最优合并方案\n85\t若干 baseM 块与尾块合并为统一大小 mTailMain\n86\t目标: 最小化窗口总计算量\n87\t\n88\t输出: mBaseTailSplitCnt, mTailMain, nBaseTailSplitCnt, nTailMain\n89\t```\n90\t\n91\t### 3.3 尾块拆分\n92\t\n93\t边缘合并后仍可能存在尾块。将大尾块切成多个小块，分给不同核并行处理。交替增长 mTailTile 和 nTailTile，优先拆尾块更大的方向。\n94\t\n95\t```\n96\t当 tailBlockCnt > 0:\n97\t  优先拆分 M/N 中尾块更大的方向\n98\t  交替增长 mTailTile, nTailTile\n99\t  约束: mTailTile ≤ CeilDiv(baseM, 16), nTailTile ≤ CeilDiv(baseN, 16)\n100\t```\n101\t\n102\t### 3.4 L0C 双缓冲\n103\t\n104\tL0C 是 Cube 累加器输出缓冲区。双缓冲（=2）允许一份被 Cube 写入时另一份被 DMA 读出到 UB，实现计算和搬移 overlap。\n105\t\n106\t```\n107\tdbL0c = (baseM × baseN × sizeof(FP32) × DB_SIZE ≤ l0cSize) ? 2 : 1\n108\t```\n109\t\n110\t### 3.5 L1 深度 + stepK\n111\t\n112\t决定 K 轴方向分段策略。A 和 B 的容量分配决定每次能载入多长的 K 段。\n113\t\n114\t```\n115\t1. 每块占用:\n116\t   base_a_size = baseM × baseK × sizeof(dtype)\n117\t   base_b_size = baseN × baseK × sizeof(dtype)\n118\t\n119\t2. 对称深度搜索（倍增搜索）:\n120\t   depth_init = _get_depth_a1b1(l1Size, base_l1_size)\n121\t   从 depth=1 逐次翻倍，直到 A+B 超过 L1 容量\n122\t\n123\t3. stepK:\n124\t   stepKa = depthA1 / DB_SIZE\n125\t   stepKb = depthB1 / DB_SIZE\n126\t   互为倍数对齐; 上限 4; 不超过 K/baseK\n127\t   stepK ∈ {1, 2, 4}（2 的幂约束）\n128\t```\n129\t\n130\t> **2 的幂约束**：`_get_depth_a1b1()` 倍增搜索使 depth 只能为 2 的幂，stepK = depth / 2。\n131\t\n132\t### 3.6 L1 缓冲数\n133\t\n134\tnBufferNum 控制 L1 中 pingpong 缓冲数量。4 缓冲比 2 缓冲能更好地隐藏 MTE2 搬移延迟。\n135\t\n136\t```\n137\tkl1 = min(stepKa, stepKb) × baseK\n138\tused_4buf = baseN × kl1 × 4 + baseM × kl1 × 4\n139\tnBufferNum = (used_4buf < l1Size) ? 4 : 2\n140\t```\n141\t\n142\t### 3.7 组装 TilingData\n143\t\n144\t将 RunInfo（内部中间态）组装为 TilingData（下发 Kernel 的最终字段）。\n145\t\n146\t```\n147\tusedCoreNum = (totalBlockCnt > 1 || tailBlockCnt == 0) ? aicNum\n148\t            : tailBlockCnt × mTailTile × nTailTile\n149\tkL1 = baseK × min(stepKa, stepKb)\n150\t```\n151\t\n152\t### 3.8 SWAT 机制 A: BLOCK_TABLE 负载均衡（a16w16 专属）\n153\t\n154\t当默认 baseM/baseN 导致各核任务量不均衡时（均衡度 < 0.88），触发查表重选：\n155\t\n156\t```\n157\t触发条件:\n158\t  singleBlockNum = mBlockCnt × nBlockCnt / aicNum ∈ [1.0, 10.0]\n159\t  defaultBalance = CalcMultiCoreBalance(M, N, aicNum, baseM, baseN) < 0.88\n160\t\n161\t若触发 → 在 BLOCK_TABLE 中查找预制评分更高的 (baseM, baseN) 组合\n162\t```\n163\t\n164\t---\n165\t\n166\t## 4. FullLoad 驻留策略\n167\t\n168\tA 或 B 全量驻留 L1，消除 K 轴重复载入。小矩阵一次载入后驻留不动，K 轴迭代时只滚动对面的大矩阵。\n169\t\n170\t### 4.1 门禁条件（五条，任一不过即回退 SWAT）\n171\t\n172\t```\n173\t1. 策略条件: 未走 StreamK 分支\n174\t   └─ StreamK 下 K 已切给多核，\"全载\"语义失效\n175\t\n176\t2. 小侧矩阵容量（至少一侧通过）:\n177\t   Bytes_A = baseM × Align(K, c0) × sizeof(dtype)\n178\t   Bytes_B = Align(K, c0) × baseN × sizeof(dtype)\n179\t   条件: min(Bytes_A, Bytes_B) × 2 ≤ L1_SIZE\n180\t\n181\t3. 对侧循环次数 T ≥ 2:\n182\t   T_A = N / (usedCoreNum × baseN)\n183\t   T_B = M / (usedCoreNum × baseM)\n184\t   └─ T = 1 → 收益为 0，不开\n185\t\n186\t4. 多核排布 (以 A-Full-Load 为例):\n187\t   mBlockCnt ≤ WINDOW_LEN(=4)\n188\t   aicNum % mBlockCnt == 0\n189\t   totalBlockCnt > aicNum\n190\t\n191\t5. 流水健康度:\n192\t   Bytes_opp = baseX × kL1 × sizeof(dtype) ≥ 20 KB\n193\t   └─ < 20 KB 时 MTE2 带宽效率低，全载收益被反噬\n194\t```\n195\t\n196\t两侧都通过时，选 min(Bytes_A, Bytes_B) 更小的那侧做全载。\n197\t\n198\t### 4.2 优化目标\n199\t\n200\t```\n201\tΔBytes = (T - 1) × baseM × K × |dtype|    # A-Full-Load\n202\t```\n203\t\n204\t典型 T=5 时，小侧 MTE2 字节下降 80%，Task 时间降低 5%~15%。\n205\t\n206\t### 4.3 字段差量（相对 SWAT）\n207\t\n208\t| 字段 | A-Full-Load | B-Full-Load |\n209\t|------|------------|------------|\n210\t| `stepKa` | CeilDiv(K, baseK) | SWAT 基线 |\n211\t| `stepKb` | 由剩余 L1 反推 | CeilDiv(K, baseK) |\n212\t| `isAFullLoad` | true | false |\n213\t| `isBFullLoad` | false | true |\n214\t| mTailTile（全载侧） | 强制 1 | SWAT 基线 |\n215\t| nTailTile（全载侧） | SWAT 基线 | 强制 1 |\n216\t| `nBufferNum` | 通常回退到 2 | 同上 |\n217\t\n218\t**isAFullLoad 与 isBFullLoad 互斥，严禁同时为 true。**\n219\t\n220\t### 4.4 L1 预算不等式\n221\t\n222\t```\n223\tA_full_load + B_streaming_pingpong ≤ L1_SIZE\n224\t\n225\tbaseM × Align(K, c0) × sizeof(dtype)                           # A 全量驻留\n226\t+ (baseN × stepKb × baseK × sizeof(dtype)) × nBufferNum        # B 流式 pingpong\n227\t≤ L1_SIZE\n228\t```\n229\t\n230\t如果溢出，自动收缩 B 侧 stepKb。缩到 1 仍溢出 → fallback SWAT。\n231\t\n232\t### 4.5 选型决策\n233\t\n234\t| 场景 | 策略 | 原因 |\n235\t|------|------|------|\n236\t| 两侧 > L1/2 | SWAT | 物理不可行 |\n237\t| 小侧 ≤ L1/2, T=1 | SWAT | 无重复搬移可消除 |\n238\t| 小侧 ≤ L1/2, T≥2, **真 MTE2 bound** (带宽 ≥ 85%) | **FullLoad** | MTE2 是瓶颈 |\n239\t| 小侧 ≤ L1/2, T≥2, 假 MTE2 bound (带宽 < 70%) | SWAT | 瓶颈不在搬移 |\n240\t| 已走 StreamK | **不叠加** | K 已切散 |\n241\t\n242\t---\n243\t\n244\t## 5. StreamK 策略\n245\t\n246\tK 轴切分给多核并行，突破 MN 欠并行瓶颈。当 M 和 N 都很小但 K 很长时，MN 二维切分 tile 数不足，把 K 也切出来分给多核。\n247\t\n248\t### 5.1 子模式门禁\n249\t\n250\t**SK（纯 Stream-K）**：MN tile 数严重不足。mCnt×nCnt ≤ aicNum/2。\n251\t\n252\t**DP+SK**：稳态走纯 DP（每核独立完整 K），仅末轮 tile 沿 K 切分。\n253\t\n254\t| 子模式 | 判定条件 |\n255\t|--------|---------|\n256\t| **SK** | `Align(K, 256) ≥ max(8192, aicNum×256) / sizeof(FP16)` 且 `mCnt×nCnt ≤ aicNum/2` |\n257\t| **DP+SK** | `M%256==0 ∧ N%256==0 ∧ K ≥ max(8192, aicNum×128) / sizeof(FP16)` ∧ `mCnt×nCnt ≥ aicNum` ∧ `(mCnt×nCnt) % aicNum ∈ (0, aicNum/2]` |\n258\t\n259\t### 5.2 函数链\n260\t\n261\t```\n262\tDoOpTiling():\n263\t  ├── IsCapable()                # 门禁判断\n264\t  ├── ResetBase()                # baseM=baseN=256\n265\t  ├── FormulateBasicBlock()      # 确定每核 K 段长度\n266\t  ├── CalBaseK()                 # L0A 容量约束\n267\t  ├── CalL1Tiling()              # depth + stepK\n268\t  ├── AdjustL1Tiling()           # 对称化修正\n269\t  └── BuildTilingData()          # 组装\n270\t```\n271\t\n272\t### 5.3 字段差量（相对 SWAT）\n273\t\n274\t| 字段 | StreamK | SWAT |\n275\t|------|---------|------|\n276\t| `skSingleCoreK` | 每核 K 段长度 | **不存在** |\n277\t| `tailInfo.kCnt` | K 方向分段数 | **不存在** |\n278\t| `kL1` | baseK × min(stepKa, stepKb, **4**) | 无 4 截断 |\n279\t| `l1BufferNum` | **2** 固定 | 2 或 4 |\n280\t| `l0cDB` | **1** 固定 | 1 或 2 |\n281\t| `usedCoreNum` | **aicNum** 固定 | 可 < aicNum |\n282\t| `mBaseTailSplitCnt` | **1** 固定 | SWAT 机制 B |\n283\t| `mTailMain` | **0** 固定 | 边缘合并产出 |\n284\t\n285\t**强制常量**：`l1BufferNum=2`、`l0cDB=1`、`mBaseTailSplitCnt=nBaseTailSplitCnt=1`、`mTailMain=nTailMain=0`、`usedCoreNum=aicNum`。\n286\t\n287\t### 5.4 Workspace\n288\t\n289\tStreamK 需要 Workspace 做跨核 partial sum 归约：\n290\t\n291\t```\n292\tGetWorkSpace() = aicNum × 256² × sizeof(FP32)    # 部分和区\n293\t               + RPC_WORKSIZE × MB_SIZE           # 跨核通信区\n294\t```\n295\t\n296\t---\n297\t\n298\t## 6. 算法选择决策树\n299\t\n300\t```\n301\t给定变体 + Shape (M, K, N, [B/g])\n302\t\n303\tStep 1 — StreamK 判定\n304\t  ├─ 通过 → StreamK\n305\t  │   强制：l1BufferNum=2, l0cDB=1\n306\t  │   batch_matmul (B≥2) 和 group_matmul 默认不启用\n307\t  └─ 不通过 → Step 2\n308\t\n309\tStep 2 — FullLoad 判定\n310\t  ├─ 通过 → FullLoad\n311\t  │   A-Full 与 B-Full 互斥，选小侧\n312\t  └─ 不通过 → SWAT（默认回退）\n313\t```\n314\t\n315\t### 典型示例\n316\t\n317\t**M=128, N=81920, K=4096 (FP16, aicNum=32) → A-FullLoad**:\n318\t```\n319\tBytes_A = 128 × 4096 × 2B = 1 MB > L1/2(=256 KB) ✘ → 不开\n320\t```\n321\t\n322\tWait, that example from the mxfp4 doc won't work for FP16. Let me use correct numbers.\n323\t\n324\t**M=512, N=512, K=16384 (FP16, aicNum=24) → SK**:\n325\t```\n326\tmCnt=2, nCnt=2, totalMNCnt=4 ≤ 12 → SK\n327\tkCnt = 24/4 = 6, skSingleCoreK = 2732\n328\tbaseK=64, stepKa=min(4,4)=4, kL1=256\n329\tWorkspace: 24 × 256² × 4 ≈ 6.3 MB\n330\t```\n331\t\n332\t**M=N=1024, K=4096**:\n333\t```\n334\tBytes_A = Bytes_B = 1024 × 4096 × 2B = 8 MB > L1/2 ✘\n335\t→ 两侧均放不下，回退 SWAT\n336\t```\n337\t\n338\t---\n339\t\n340\t## 7. 跨变体公共约束\n341\t\n342\t| 约束 | 值 | 适用范围 |\n343\t|------|----|---------|\n344\t| `CUBE_BLOCK` | 16 | 所有变体 |\n345\t| `DB_SIZE` | 2 | 所有变体 |\n346\t| `WINDOW_LEN` | 4 | SWAT 机制 B |\n347\t| `BASEM_BASEN_RATIO` | 2 | 所有变体，baseM/baseN 最大比例 |\n348\t| stepK 取值 | {1, 2, 4} | SWAT/FullLoad（StreamK 有例外 stepK=3） |\n349\t| L1 缓冲数 | 4 或 2（不存在 1） | SWAT/FullLoad |\n350\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b6470fe4a93f2d7d","type":"function","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"find /home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B/home -maxdepth 4 -type d 2>/dev/null | head -20; echo \\\"===\\\"; find /home/vince/.claude/jobs/09264df0/tmp/gate-088/tier1/p1B -maxdepth 2 -name \\\"*.py\\\" -o -maxdepth 2 -name \\\"*.cpp\\\" -o -maxdepth 2 -name \\\"*.h\\\" -o -maxdepth 2 -name \\\"*.md\\\" 2>/dev/null | grep -v agent-skills | head -20\",\"description\":\"Search for kernel source files in sandbox home\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b6470fe